<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>How Many More?</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
background:#080808;
color:white;
font-family:Inter,sans-serif;
overflow-x:hidden;
line-height:1.8;
}

section{
min-height:100vh;
padding:100px 10%;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
justify-content:center;
}

.hero{
text-align:center;
}

.hero h1{
font-family:"Playfair Display",serif;
font-size:5rem;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero p{
font-size:1.4rem;
color:#d0d0d0;
max-width:700px;
margin:auto;
}

.button{
margin-top:50px;
display:inline-block;
padding:18px 40px;
border:1px solid white;
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
transition:.3s;
}

.button:hover{
background:white;
color:black;
}

.quote{
font-family:"Playfair Display";
font-size:3rem;
max-width:900px;
margin:auto;
text-align:center;
color:#f5f5f5;
}

.small{
margin-top:30px;
font-size:1.2rem;
color:#999;
}

.cards{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
gap:30px;
margin-top:50px;
}

.card{
padding:30px;
border:1px solid #333;
background:#111;
transition:.4s;
}

.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-8px);
border-color:#b00020;
}

.card h2{
margin-bottom:15px;
font-family:"Playfair Display";
}

.letter{
max-width:900px;
margin:auto;
font-size:1.3rem;
}

.final{
text-align:center;
}

.final h1{
font-size:4rem;
font-family:"Playfair Display";
margin-bottom:30px;
}

footer{
padding:60px;
text-align:center;
color:#777;
}

.fade{
opacity:0;
transform:translateY(60px);
transition:1s;
}

.fade.show{
opacity:1;
transform:translateY(0);
}

.background{
position:fixed;
top:0;
left:0;
width:100%;
height:100%;
pointer-events:none;
overflow:hidden;
z-index:-1;
}

.circle{
position:absolute;
width:4px;
height:4px;
background:white;
border-radius:50%;
opacity:.2;
animation:float 15s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes float{
from{
transform:translateY(100vh);
}
to{
transform:translateY(-100vh);
}
}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="background" id="bg"></div>

<section class="hero">

<h1>How Many More?</h1>

<p>

Every headline is a life interrupted.<br><br>

Every statistic is someone's daughter, sister, friend, mother, or child.<br><br>

Women deserve to live without fear.

</p>

<a class="button" href="#letter">
Demand Accountability
</a>

</section>

<section class="fade">

<div class="quote">

"We are taught how to stay safe.

But who is being taught not to harm?"

<div class="small">

Safety should not depend on fear.

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section class="fade">

<h1 style="font-family:Playfair Display;font-size:3rem;">
What Needs To Change
</h1>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">
<h2>Accountability</h2>
Public institutions should investigate crimes promptly, transparently, and fairly.
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Justice</h2>
Timely legal processes are essential while protecting due process for everyone involved.
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Support</h2>
Every survivor deserves compassionate medical, legal, and psychological care.
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Prevention</h2>
Education on consent, respect, and equality helps build safer communities.
</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="letter" class="fade">

<div class="letter">

<h1 style="font-family:Playfair Display;font-size:3.5rem;margin-bottom:40px;">
An Open Letter
</h1>

<p>

We are tired.

Not because we have stopped hoping.

But because every time another woman becomes another headline, we hear promises before we see change.

Women should not have to calculate routes, share live locations, clutch keys, or avoid going out after dark simply to feel safe.

We ask our institutions to treat violence against women with urgency, transparency, and accountability.

We call for better implementation of laws, survivor-centered support, timely investigations, and sustained efforts to prevent gender-based violence.

This is not a demand for privilege.

It is a demand for dignity, safety, and equal protection under the law.

</p>

</div>

</section>

<section class="final fade">

<h1>

We are not asking for miracles.

<br><br>

We are asking for accountability.

</h1>

<a class="button">

Stand In Solidarity

</a>

</section>

<footer>

Created to encourage peaceful civic engagement and support for safer communities.

</footer>

<script>

const observer=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>{
entries.forEach(entry=>{
if(entry.isIntersecting){
entry.target.classList.add("show");
}
});
});

document.querySelectorAll(".fade").forEach(el=>{
observer.observe(el);
});

const bg=document.getElementById("bg");

for(let i=0;i<100;i++){

const c=document.createElement("div");

c.className="circle";

c.style.left=Math.random()*100+"%";

c.style.animationDuration=(10+Math.random()*10)+"s";

c.style.animationDelay=Math.random()*10+"s";

bg.appendChild(c);

}

</script>

</body>
</html>
